sante pour qu’il se sépare d’une partie de sa fortune.  Gail, la mère de Paul, femme forte et dévouée, va tout faire pour obtenir la libération de son fils. Elle s’allie à Fletcher Chace, le mystérieux chef de la sécurité du milliardaire et tous deux se lancent dans une course contre la montre face à des ravisseurs déterminés, instables et brutaux.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6nE9Hf0ezszjI4DbCxwzQ73MMy.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wJLTRnFKAVDDD7ci2L1eVnNJ7aI.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.5,"vote_count":2499,"age_rating":"R","year":"2017","release_date":"2017-12-21","runtime_minutes":132,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["جريمة","تاريخ","إثارة","دراما"],"genre_keys":["crime","history","thriller","drama"],"similar":["mv14574","mv247","mv1949","mv80278","mv338766","mv396371","mv392572","mv2207"],"director":"ريدلي سكوت","cast":[{"name":"ميشيل وليمز","character":"Gail Harris","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jn3BVMVbIptz2gc6Fhxo1qwJVvW.jpg"},{"name":"مارك والبيرغ","character":"Fletcher Chase","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1Oc3XSLyb8hxmjmlgFENu582Kqw.jpg"},{"name":"كريستوفر بلامر","character":"Jean Paul Getty","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u0YBwss0ebEUp8sjRtQKnK2wZdR.jpg"},{"name":"تشارلي بلامر","character":"John Paul Getty III","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u2ig0kkgxq36BMbFQ4DEWfu5G3A.jpg"},{"name":"Romain Duris","character":"Cinquanta","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/70KN228eNpvouPTCxDSurnCzx9G.jpg"},{"name":"Timothy Hutton","character":"Oswald Hinge","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oWVtWGEauBs0zXrk0cWqiqYxJtN.jpg"},{"name":"Charlie Shotwell","character":"John Paul Getty III (Age 7)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wNA0VZueKeNhTjkNhuX0Fnz0cVz.jpg"},{"name":"Andrew Buchan","character":"John Paul Getty II","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3HvxEwBY