title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"القصة التي لا تنسى لعائلة واجهت إلى جانب عشرات الآلاف من الغرباء واحدة من أسوأ الكوارث الطبيعية في عصرنا الحالي.","description_en":"In December 2004, close-knit family Maria, Henry and their three sons begin their winter vacation in Thailand. But the day after Christmas, the idyllic holiday turns into an incomprehensible nightmare when a terrifying roar rises from the depths of the sea, followed by a wall of black water that devours everything in its path. Though Maria and her family face their darkest hour, unexpected displays of kindness and courage ameliorate their terror.","description_fr":"L’histoire d’une famille prise dans une des plus terribles catastrophes naturelles récentes. The Impossible raconte comment un couple et leurs enfants en vacances en Thaïlande sont séparés par le tsunami du 26 décembre 2004. Au milieu de centaines de milliers d’autres personnes, ils vont tenter de survivre et de se retrouver. D’après une histoire vraie.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0DLCiDbnYywOHiISALbl2EH2NE.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3NfM0sRwVLnsQkCd5YBPGvM9a5v.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.4,"vote_count":6937,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2012","release_date":"2012-09-09","runtime_minutes":113,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["دراما","إثارة","تاريخ","مغامرة"],"genre_keys":["drama","thriller","history","adventure"],"similar":["mv14574","mv429300","mv446791","mv2207","mv254128","mv567","mv11324","mv530915"],"director":"خوان أنطونيو بايونا","cast":[{"name":"Naomi Watts","character":"Maria Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7ysvff7ZhW388SIh2YjQ0XIryOn.jpg"},{"name":"إيوان مكريغور","character":"Henry Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q2UDxfwWnmXTB7khOUF3J9puBVP.jpg"},{"name":"توم هولاند","character":"Lucas Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD