ves that she is being haunted by the souls of those killed by the guns manufactured by her company.","description_fr":"Proche de San Francisco se situe la maison la plus hantée au monde : construite par Sarah Winchester, riche héritière de l’entreprise d’armes Winchester, elle est en perpétuelle construction et contient des centaines de pièces. Sarah y construit une prison, un asile pour les centaines d’esprits vengeurs tués par ses armes, et le plus terrifiant d’entre eux veut en découdre avec sa famille…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4D9Bby0pNtRUYeI5mNJ3F0mSmXG.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d4wnMDSrQonB9iArMzd90WqaoJ4.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.9,"vote_count":1864,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2018","release_date":"2018-02-02","runtime_minutes":100,"status":"Released","country":"أستراليا","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["رعب","إثارة","خيالي","دراما","غموض"],"genre_keys":["horror","thriller","fantasy","drama","mystery"],"similar":["mv567","mv11324","mv14574","mv1949","mv521029","mv542156","mv713364","mv13389"],"director":"Michael Spierig, Peter Spierig","cast":[{"name":"Helen Mirren","character":"Sarah Winchester","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1reKRrsdsHXJaRVHVyOEg4oPTcZ.jpg"},{"name":"جيسون كلارك","character":"Dr. Eric Price","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/quH4y2dto3UAgZOfaM0QriyRLPN.jpg"},{"name":"سارة سنوك","character":"Marian Marriott","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w9xv72oaTISLgeT381fU4Jor9GV.jpg"},{"name":"Finn Scicluna-O'Prey","character":"Henry Marriott","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xnEwrEaPXBTLPx4RJecdOzSbTCy.jpg"},{"name":"Emm Wiseman","character":"Nancy","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hSFDX7wK6C6vaUexG2vOrTZwOwB.jpg"},{"name":"Alana Fagan","character":"Partially Dressed Lady #1","profile_image":null},{"name":"Rebecca Makar","character":"Partially Dressed Lady #2","profile_image":null},{"name":"Tyler Coppin","character":"Art